title: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The review drawer
route: /manager?tab=reviews (drawer over the list)
intro: Opening a review shows the draft an agent wrote, the four Integrity checks and the buttons to sign or open the case. What the clinician can do depends on the review's status: a clean draft, a draft with one check to look at, a review that needs an update, or one already signed.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click the case ID or 'Open' on a review row"
overlay o1 "Drawer slides in from the right (640 px)\nTitle 'R-0856 · Summit'\nSubtitle 'Continued-stay review 2 · Residential 3.5 · due Tue 9:00 am'\nStatus pill at the top right"
screen b1 "Top of the body\n'J.S., 51 · privacy mode'   'Drafted by' Scribe (Residential, Detox) or Cadence (PHP, IOP)"
screen b2 "'The draft'\nLarge text box with seven parts: title and payer lines, Clinical status, Treatment progress, Risk and safety, Why this level of care still fits, Request"
screen b3 "'Integrity checks'\n'Every sentence traced to the chart'\n'Review has no errors'\n'All payer requirements covered'\n'Level of care matches the request'"
screen b4 "Footer\n'Sign review' (green), 'Open case', 'Close'"

decision d1 "What is the review's status?"
process t1 "'Drafted', all four checks green ticks\nDraft can be edited\nBanner: 'Signing is one review at a time. Your edits to the draft are saved with the signature.'"
process t2 "'Drafted' with 'Check to look at'\nOne check is amber with Integrity's note, for example 'The draft asks for 7 days. Beacon's usual limit at this level of care is 5.'\nDraft can be edited"
process t3 "'Needs your update'\nAmber panel names what is missing; 'All payer requirements covered' is red\nDraft is locked: 'The draft is locked until your update is added.'\n'Sign review' is greyed, hover text 'Add your update first'"
process t4 "'Signed'\nDraft is read-only\nFooter shows 'Signed by Heather K., LISW-S' in place of the button"

input i1 "Edit the draft text"
click c1 "Click 'Sign review'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › Sign a review"
goto g2 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › Add your update to a review"

click c2 "Click 'Open case'"
process p1 "Go to /authorizations/case/ and the case ID, with ?tab=draft\nThe drawer is gone with the page"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case › Draft tab"
screen n1 "Some cases show 'Request not found' (see 'Open a case from the tracker')"

click c3 "Click 'Close', the X, the dimmed area, or press Escape"
decision d2 "Was the review a draft?"
store st1 "Edits to the draft are saved on the review\nOpen it again and the edited text is there"
process p2 "Nothing to save"
end e1 "Back on the list, same place"

s1 --> o1 --> b1 --> b2 --> b3 --> b4 --> d1
d1 -->|Clean draft| t1
d1 -->|One check to look at| t2
d1 -->|Missing item| t3
d1 -->|Already signed| t4
t1 --> i1
t2 --> i1
t1 --> c1 --> g1
t2 --> c1
t3 --> g2
t4 --> c2
t1 --> c2
c2 --> p1 --> g3
p1 -.-> n1
b4 --> c3 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes: Drafted| st1 --> e1
d2 -->|No| p2 --> e1
